# Everything text is LF in the repo and in the working copy. Contributors
# work on Windows, macOS, Linux and WSL against the same files; a CRLF
# checkout would show every file as modified next to a POSIX one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF — party.sh is run by a POSIX shell, and a
# CRLF checkout makes it fail on its very first line.
*.sh text eol=lf
